{"id":"vod_bf_12352","vodId":"12352","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"海贼王女","name_cn":"海贼王女","date":"2021-01-01","year":"2021","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-13/53de259d38ea278cda7ffc64d959b656.jpg"},"summary":"电视动画《海贼王女》是由中泽一登负责导演，2021年放送予定。《海贼王女》是以主角“菲娜·豪特曼（フェナ・ハウトマン）”的旅途以及成长之路为主轴展开。故事描述，菲娜在与她父亲乘船旅行时受到海贼袭击，仅她一人靠着小艇漂流到了国家公认的风化岛“香格里拉（シャングリラ）”。10 年后，亭亭玉立的菲娜准备展开她首次“工作”的同时，她下定了逃离这座岛的决心。在本作的制作小组部分，导演是由 中泽一登、剧本为 洼山阿佐子、音乐交给了 梶浦由记负责。而声优的部分，主角菲娜将由 瀬戸麻沙美、雪丸由 铃木崚汰、紫檀由 樱井孝宏、花梨由 悠木碧、槐由 佐藤元、枫由 逢坂良太、椿由 大须贺纯、真桦由 田中进太郎、萨尔曼交由 村治学、奥托则是由 平田广明担纲演出。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-09 20:30:23","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/haizeiwangnv/第12集/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T09:15:29.481Z"}